ageCount":null,"textLength":597,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b975-19\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"ARN8\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b975-20\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}